 "source": ";; Several constructs interacting: a procedure that binds, branches,\n;; quasiquotes, and comments. The one file allowed to be messy.\n(define (summarise numbers) ; kitchen: bind, branch, quote, comment\n(let loop ((xs numbers)\n(acc 0)\n(seen '()))\n(cond\n((null? xs)\n;; done: emit a quoted summary\n`((sum ,acc)\n(seen ,@(reverse seen))))\n((not (number? (car xs)))\n(loop (cdr xs) acc seen))\n(else\n(let ((n (car xs))) ; trailing inside the loop\n(if (negative? n)\n(loop (cdr xs) acc seen)\n(loop (cdr xs)\n(+ acc n)\n(cons n seen))))))))\n\n(define sample\n(list 1\n-2\n3\n#f\n4))\n\n(define (run)\n(summarise sample))\n",
